<TestCaseEntity>
   <description>Mirrors Jira PT-269 (manually tested/passed 6/17/2026 by Lejla): when show-react-portal-poc is OFF, the React shell must not render, and users must still be able to reach SCiEnable and SCiSupplier via their existing direct URLs without disruption. PT-269 itself notes the exact fallback behavior (redirect/404/"coming soon") was still an open PM question as of the source ticket — this script only asserts the shell does NOT render and that direct-URL access still works, not a specific fallback UI. Uses ffOffSupplierEmail (Regression profile), an account confirmed flagged-out as of PT-266 (6/17/2026) — reconfirm current flag state with Lejla/PostHog before trusting a failure as a real regression vs. a stale flag assumption.</description>
   <name>TC_FeatureFlag_ShellNotRendered_FallbackWorks</name>
